Revision history for LibTmux

Unreleased
    - Add Server->capabilities reports from the selected running daemon,
      with copied feature metadata and shared cursor-shape admission.
      Discovery requires its native run-shel spelling to remain unaliased.
    - Compare complete release spellings, ordering development and candidate
      builds below final releases. at_least rejects banners and trailing
      whitespace; remove command output line endings before comparing.
    - Add a "What is on here" capability directory to the LibTmux::Server documentation.
    - Add "What is on here" capability directories to the LibTmux::Session, LibTmux::Window and LibTmux::Pane documentation.

0.003  2026-11-13
    - Link CPAN installation, native POD and the shared API reference.
    - Set the documentation homepage in distribution metadata.

0.002
    - Initial core: explicit tmux operations, captured graphs and array-backed filtering.
    - Requires Perl 5.44; qualifies Linux x86_64 LP64 and tmux 3.3a–3.8.
